## 10. Decision rules

- Do not use valuation to time the short term.
- A stock qualifies only if it passes the survival filter and is priced at or below bear value.
- Treat borrower-seat equities as options on refinancing, sized accordingly.
- Re-run the sector test whenever a large buyer changes its capex guidance.

## 11. Limits

- The scenarios and multiples are judgement, not estimates from data.
- The framework gives point estimates with wide error bands.
- Several facts about supplier financing come from press reports and a video, and are not verified here.
- Prices are moving by 10% or more a day, so any snapshot goes stale quickly.
